this conversation. Jimmy?

280
00:14:18.024 --> 00:14:19.984
Because I took six kilos
from that disco

281
00:14:19.985 --> 00:14:21.152
before we burned it down.

282
00:14:23.071 --> 00:14:26.448
Fuck! Jesus Christ.
Zip that shit up.

283
00:14:26.449 --> 00:14:27.742
Goddamnit!

284
00:14:29.119 --> 00:14:31.245
Look. we could use the money
to help Pat's ma and his kid.

285
00:14:31.246 --> 00:14:32.788
If it even is his fucking kid.

286
00:14:32.789 --> 00:14:34.915
To be frank with you. Eamon.

287
00:14:34.916 --> 00:14:36.083
you know. you're giving
all this money away

288
00:14:36.084 --> 00:14:38.627
