that fucking mess. okay?

306
00:15:24.007 --> 00:15:25.633
Don't go against me on this.

307
00:15:25.634 --> 00:15:27.009
I'm gonna fuckin' burn
this shit.

308
00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.218
-But I'm just... I...
-Look. we don't

309
00:15:28.219 --> 00:15:30.054
