who stole your cocaine.

318
00:15:55.789 --> 00:15:58.499
We need fucking answers.

319
00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.709
You tell every corner boy
from Jamaica to Jerome

320
00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.628
that if so much as
a gram of my coke shows up.

321
00:16:02.629 --> 00:16:04.963
