-And you let them know that

323
00:16:06.758 --> 00:16:08.884
any stupid motherfucker
caught trying to sell

324
00:16:08.885 --> 00:16:10.844
my product. they're gonna die.

325
00:16:10.845 --> 00:16:12.346
I understand.

326
00:16:12.347 --> 00:16:14.515
Whoever fucking robbed you

327
