-He's got brass fucking balls.

332
00:16:23.858 --> 00:16:25.526
Yeah.

333
00:16:25.527 --> 00:16:27.404
One day. I'm gonna
shove them up his ass.

334
00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.532
