'cause he knows that I like 'em.

360
00:18:19.808 --> 00:18:21.391
And Eileen liked them too.

361
00:18:21.392 --> 00:18:23.853
Yeah. They were her favorite.

362
00:18:27.357 --> 00:18:28.941
So. I been trying.

363
00:18:28.942 --> 00:18:31.819
I've been trying to form

364
00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.404
