with the rest?

400
00:20:18.885 --> 00:20:20.344
Don't worry. Eddie.
you'll get your cut.

401
00:20:20.345 --> 00:20:21.512
Yeah.

402
00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:25.767
Get a hold of Leon. will ya?

403
00:20:26.809 --> 00:20:27.936
Tell him I wanna see him.

404
00:20:30.146 --> 00:20:31.230
Okay.

405
00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.070
