452
00:24:11.826 --> 00:24:13.910
Are you fuckin' jokin' me?

453
00:24:13.911 --> 00:24:15.412
[Bridget] I'm sorry. Brendan.

454
00:24:15.413 --> 00:24:17.247
It's gone. and it's
probably in a landfill.

455
00:24:17.248 --> 00:24:20.041
which is good 'cause it means
it won't be discovered.

456
00:24:20.042 --> 00:24:21.586
and it will not be
traced back...

457
00:24:24.172 --> 00:24:25.452
